    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62422c7038eb37923a09717",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时,加速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a202b19ce79270ed21a55733bef718be704030c3505488c82d5dc94c27e0c45c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106802211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106802211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a44009dcfbf6e6a2ba3d6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初段若余力十足则向前突进\\n并之后在最终直线处\\n稍微再向前突进＜领放・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "57dda5633b5d9881e6b3400e757a3ea8cbd3e052e211d2944e61815574e446dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106803111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106803111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb6b08b3b2a9087aeb53ab1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的直线若位于前方\\n则提升加速度,并之后在最终直线处\\n稍微再向前突进＜领放・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "eea831cce689a61346eb389762a73c8a7338b139a315a514281f9e4c8bbe77a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106803211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106803211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df84de694bc6cae2f3cce8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道上若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3369bbeb007ce63d73608a86c36e8a7d53e1a1529ee581a6baec661bcb2e7c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106901111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106901111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd5e38e39d15f36580006f2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道处迅速向前突进\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d8d78c7481c13f44b55124ef6d148d1092f79dba7f9cc4159764fed6a13b75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106901121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106901121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7685be3e6be053dadaac3c63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "非常擅长春季的比赛\\n速度与力量大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "75617cd1166cbed1997140c9f87767bf7c728269c956d67cc23469fc1cfdecbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106901211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106901211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fdfb1c0fd952ba8d360898b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在直线上速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b9cf404d4ba388311c96294c7aa9f91867803f0bcc18bf985ff3ed1a72650fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106902111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106902111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a1c9aad43d79910b29c9985",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘,在中间集团竞争时\\n恢复体力\\n并提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d85839cbe55fc783bde6e899becc4a5d52749aaa10edeab41070151ba5ac0f7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106902211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/106902211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b505a7950721baafdd52296",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线若处于好位置\\n则大幅提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7191db74dbd35c482a42fc78eba416212aac7b00f44120917e364fe02db0ee2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107001111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107001111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:229e7f8624ae5a60edd8020c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前列时\\n大幅提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "eefacaeecbfe6940784f6a9e1775f8539a7ba66b84b23c9ae3b774cf6e855e11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107001211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107001211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9471c62508038c17fe448b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初段若位于前方\\n则速度稍微提升并回复体力\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "deddbe9be65c2e22816d410e9c35769e90c2883ff1bf72ad449e31a038d320eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107001221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107001221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85947f8ead8f8a12610dd6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "力量和速度提升\\n若场地状态为「稍重」「重」「不良」\\n则变为大幅提升＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b0415650ce8c259a468e4ce2ae51d3ba3597217b64947cbb9ad8de7cd37fcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107002111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107002111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d39bb9b16fb1b0c3c280764",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则提升力量与速度；若人气较高\\n则随后在剩余800m处位于中团时\\n加速度稍微提升且稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ee9607dff51b5e54ebc84f6dc58f6aaf49bbeba2588e5909416c1df790223f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107002121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107002121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b32e11d760f2010871857fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期若位于中间位置\\n则更早时间内向前突进,若是「稍重」「重」\\n「不良」场地状态,则额外略微\\n提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7487b39997a9cae83868aafbd6b029bca308011d0cd1c36ed8ae920435d2e18f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107002211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107002211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350f874e668b87191dda4cc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc9c411403cfc8cf437a4bfa8f7259f4f4b46748421e834b1d660d8fc2df04b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107101111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107101111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd7b24f9a0ab3aec8832a29a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线若处于好位置\\n则大幅提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7191db74dbd35c482a42fc78eba416212aac7b00f44120917e364fe02db0ee2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107101211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107101211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2e76cff368487eab5790ce1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛接近终盘时,回复持久力\\n并稍微提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "55ce7e24bccb8dc4d76853db7b7bd612b89c254fad0ef8325d5531b3be9a768f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107102111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107102111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d62a2f47096fc35ede3a97c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘初期,回复少量耐力\\n并少量提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "533146bb791a03edc83221a00f562ebca9b3145b5f2964282d6531520316929c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107102121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107102121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db61ab01c69e70f1c3b023b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线上,稍微消耗体力\\n使速度极大提升\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4427be2f708fd3114828cc066a872ca3b2655cf1d27bd086f15108b8139be811",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107102211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107102211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a0ba1ce520d6eff228cdae6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成超越时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b32b64aad448c807f20ff87e6c17ac4bf4d788387ddad802c9788afaef2dc263",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107201111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107201111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30d028d95ac25002d0fadb19",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之前遭遇阻挡时\\n速度大幅提升\\n并且微幅提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "076ab88b90ca3769743a9cbfcf77c6eaf217d87cbe1e1628cb1a6d7c11e1dd9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107201211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107201211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6c3d0ef3921d29324d01584",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘最终弯道及往后,准备超越时\\n一段时间内向前突进\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "78fbd593341d82976f5b8bb99f0abb9ef2c1b72f23bc5e9c3a67bd26274db529",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107201221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107201221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3566c6038bf265e1c16cd007",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道位于队伍中间往前时\\n若距离终点尚远则提升加速度\\n之后在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n稍微提升速度＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78cbf531fa62ea40491166f42acfda2cd14df6759e9f8ce89c8b0818ff356f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107202111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107202111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9721daa8d3b287d14e92545f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段进行追赶时会向前突进\\n若位于内侧跑道则效果提升\\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4470a9807c34d888de9ded2465fa0412d35b950e5bdf77d135ca3c9283fb8f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107202211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107202211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be8bd38f2227fb5727048f93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在弯道上速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0be9988549034df832f30674079b2cbc98a82439d26b06ade7cf40e5181802a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107301111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107301111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae63cd3f7a0dda7b18d1f29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在弯道上向前突进\\n并稍微回复耐力＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d123dbe7d41e36450b1fdd426b5e4805e595c2679f9582f2cbcacc80ce66467",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107301211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107301211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b71d017a58c922dd96d12e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘进行超越时\\n在最终直线上速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da1bada2852a5730cd1c04d5e5f765ed89a1ab1cf276effeca00e4b5ef631fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10731"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/10731"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed10cafb56b212e7978c46f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘被超越时\\n大幅回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "80557e5c37e7ff164f9c98cafa35f608b04324839c2c681b2a5621d1802c3002",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107401111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107401111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfead0090760036b7cdbd1e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘开始时若身处中间集团\\n则稍微降低速度\\n超大幅回复持久力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10d3e627142b8d4a42a0e235e70fefc85d02db97a61be6036a7861004ec7ced",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107401211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107401211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdebc4989dec553206e68d13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘一段时间内\\n速度少量提升\\n若耐力有十二分充足时\\n技能持续时间增加＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "dffd64999e547d77f1f06563aaf23c2e78a2095a7749ef67e08a7e236e2f53f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107402111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107402111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07e41d9393352d9e2a065b50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘进行赶超时\\n一段时间内向前突击\\n若耐力有十二分充足时\\n技能持续时间增加＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3bf4493d25527e5a00c8b103730ecf19562422298c1300d18c6636e366bdc5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107402211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107402211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92593f8719ca90755a9dec88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时,若位于队伍中间及以后\\n则一段时间内速度提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4ed452d6268fee9ac9f2f1d08b5591451203353506cf2f87610bb5e8815f7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107403111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107403111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc81c30d9b49aebc9fca51d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在2000m以上的比赛中\\n若比赛终盘初段余力十足\\n则大幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ef03dbf524126de063fdb4c19fb02102cf8f359216ec0f202e64373e117d9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107403211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107403211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73218c2ca7d102972973385e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘极大提高速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4715a833812fc1ddadabeb8de7b361a7241dd22796350e833abcadcec6224262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107601111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107601111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85388c785c35e9306d70b97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段余力十足的话\\n迅速向前突进\\n＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e83d7deba37d06c568e131d5a5c5fbb960a26d5982670f6b89561d4bc9a79a62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107601211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107601211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2a1acab86fcbb16010b69bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "耐力极为充足时，耐力与\n速度大幅提升<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a936f201cfa56f0b766547198fb996dd85a62b327daaaf5928af65dcbfec6ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107602111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107602111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ba6ddfbc4bfe7057d8d886",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段试图超越时\n速度大幅提升\n之后在最后冲刺过程中\n速度稍微提升<居中·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "8290b695b3260c85adad25a1f271f82990d639b6da5547c22766cd7210ba8c05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107602211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107602211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4904913e8ccd0f520fb37224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "力量和速度少量提升\\n若马场状态为「良」则大幅提升力量和速度\\n＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cc7e27b984754032bf79028dc3336e9c87c2fccaca7be4ac72f4c3b261d90b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107701111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107701111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d0bd40fe5a5e44b0753a18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛临近终盘时若在队伍前方\\n则提升速度,并在之后最终冲刺时\\n稍微提升加速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d6a9581eeb20eff4456a7a625227d00be6ec5b092201432a931c5014d9841bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107701211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107701211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a4ea8c542738367164a602d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘初期大幅回复耐力＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "81eac8f1e883764b855d2088a751a956639eacdfcbcf5d7c638dc9189b41a05c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107702111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107702111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c456c4079a7f2f54bb8047ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时,大幅消耗耐力\\n并在一段时间内大幅提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "19bc9700263ac7eeac9428d555cabad166eae4fc30d697deec55044aa5a31835",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107702211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107702211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c689b29e792d105d3779c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时大幅向前突进\\n并稍微回复耐力＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc8d550aa6d20fca8d836ebe1b6ac6b9b8195319b55c685ac3417066930ed99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107703111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107703111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf499d61c84377f139c74a2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘开始时若余力充足则向前\\n突进，随后在最终直道上稍微\\n向前突进＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7a77baf8a83d308c6f703eb0f82535ac77a7b730eb406863c49cbcd8dc48d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107703211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107703211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced78ba8c68c919b12e06cc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d7eb2abba4a5969c476b5ad7dde9710acc568b354dc0f24d4f1f7a907e13bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107801111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107801111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d14d96999068a76520885ca3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘、身处第二名之后的位置\\n并且距离领先位置距离在两马身以内时\\n速度持续提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "028fcff777d6d334a0066461e4dc4fbe0b2109ef5d78a580a013feae8b6ba07a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107801211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107801211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcefcc13607c1f9f6f699532",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段位于第三名开外时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "484a3570d91c702140125f8fd29227c6638fcc4ec87c717633a653708503387c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107801221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107801221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14ffd166085b53b78c8aa2f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n一段时间内速度提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a92ad5b0b1d57edc33c989f594081a37ca0be0ce6b318b6ad9517314961cc85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107802111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107802111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf61ef39e6d5a5188958b196",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将进入终盘的位置以及往后\\n若位于第一或者距离第一名4马身以内时\\n一段时间内速度少量提升＜先行・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "22106479693ce978ede07bee8dd3426370b9e0c3fdfab1e93bc22d60c2d00469",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107802211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107802211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c48405fe87ec5df58fcb47fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线上速度提升\\n若是泥地比赛则一段时间内\\n速度提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42493b271a968340d2cfa603bf47db2f75d0c520359a3344a07121e95bd0354",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107901111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107901111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b62597247557d26a42cd84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若进行了冲刺比拼,比赛进入最后200m时\\n大幅向前突进＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b8ac1dc4f2db32f2a1bdb6343196ce1b809861e6759b0dd0d24c1642a12ba6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107901211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/107901211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8fa64044c729066ede07926",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘发动多个技能时,提升加速度\\n如果比赛为英里或中距离\\n则技能效果增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "6794e6273f520292f7fd7e0a54dbddd38eb99085a16d6e11dba2dc6a987ed49e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108001111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108001111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0ca6cfa7988d0ce1a93ccf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近中盘若位于前方\\n则大幅提升速度＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "108e685331d8f02dd4d2b75db7dd3a6c3fc09e205274bdaf8445ea1968a66968",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108001211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108001211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f378aa5e5ce975802693cc08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘多次发动技能\\n则加速力会提升，若未晚出发\\n之后会在最终冲刺时\\n少量提升加速力＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a6e138aa913e172ca8aac449fb2c0f6c312e4b095a0646b3862ade45f7f8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108002111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108002111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8a8f8a2f4e0667fe16b203",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前的第3弯道\\n位于前方则会向前冲出，之后\\n当对手赛马娘发动速度技能时\\n会小幅向前冲出＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "378d67b2a4818d610b81d66f924fd31e2dfe545d34ac82b246a753e37313b8dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108002211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108002211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1aa2ced30dcca9717ecb543",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的初期位于前方时\\n加速力会提升，在1800m及以下的\\n比赛中，则会在终盘初期的较早阶段\\n提升加速力＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae62fe5bd74c78605929eb8739a2240721dfdef48759fc686d4a569565da6de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108101111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108101111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7f7fe173bcb60d8b51d596",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘消耗少量耐力\\n在一段时间内大幅提升速度\\n＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba6463480196fc9fd4f10e75671bbff1b691fbf681c9d877e29718727feffd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108101211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108101211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3363cff5a8d28f31e5a0ca52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘超过别人时,一段时间内\\n速度提升,若智力有十二分聪慧时\\n技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a58f8fe0903e9e53fec87d06b4d3e66dbe2d116e018def0cb3b98ebc82a33ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108201111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108201111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e32379e9b59b676473d95d52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在刚进入比赛终盘时,若位于前方\\n则加速度提升,在之后剩余200m位置\\n速度稍微提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f5daf218baf3529a96927f19300e10b068f4867b4a726781209cca0d08f8f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108201211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108201211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a930590bc87d13889396a9df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若位于中间集团以后\\n速度提升,之后在最终直线上\\n消耗少量持久力,稍微向前突进\\n＜追赶・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca008b21147ec504ef63f4f5f15bd7d65c62c11050e2bc703767edb3cc05af3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108202111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108202111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:002759b95d53b307b49d03a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若直到比赛后半阶段一直保持在后方\\n则在终盘初段更早时间内提升加速力\\n之后在最终盘初段\\n微幅向前突进＜追赶・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f283d6cc79530b7be2da4ae7987a45cda5376bcf907b9d19b519d372a9ef66f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108202211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108202211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7f048f929b19796c517052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺时位于中间集团往后\\n则消耗少量耐力来提升加速度,如果在中山竞马场\\n则不产生消耗并回复少量体力＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5071477e611f9aaefbb592eb56d191c87b259d629565418766fab5b9aa4803c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108301111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108301111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a134e9a4d926bbdf8682c70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘位于后方时\\n速度提升并回复少量体力＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e9657193e745976e4ebc311c76507c3b3ca186f4cbd4bfcf8c0e82e41ce451b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108301211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108301211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de1248efee965332d8216b9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘,在中间集团竞争时\\n少量恢复体力,并大幅提升速度\\n稍微提升除自身外的己方队伍成员速度\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df853c3045dfd6b082053fe96783f50ecac13b0fe85797f96f6258cd3ebeccd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108302111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108302111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18712844537b35a288e85987",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于队伍中后方时\\n一段时间内加速度提升\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "db843e24189ccfcb674629a4c947b7e117f45abb70839cc39c74ba4c14d12afb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108302211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/108302211"
    }
  ]
}
